          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "FDecaYed"
            },
            "body": "Closing in favor of #5819, which fixes the same root cause on main. With full-iteration CUDA graphs and PP > 1, stage-specific batch preparation sets unused fields of the cached static batch to `None`, and the next refresh fails. #5819 returns a copy of the container shells that keeps the cached tensors. It is still open and not merged.\n\nThe nested tuple/list/dict refresh added here has no consumer on main today. Its fallback of silently reallocating mismatched tensors could also leave a captured graph reading stale buffers. The branch is kept for reference.\n",
            "createdAt": "2026-10-26T13:43:06Z",
